  "solution": "Given equation: 144 - 12 + 18 × 6 ÷ 24 = 96.\n\nBODMAS Table: \n\n [IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/d50192f098c21078501d30eeafe1a8c64bc30dd9621c48caa8a39ffc60f68b64.png] \n\nLet's check each option one by one.\n\n**Option 1) - and ÷**\n\nGiven: 144 - 12 + 18 × 6 ÷ 24 = 96\n\nAfter interchanging the numbers we get;\n\n⇒ __**144 ÷ 12**__ + 18 × 6 - 24 = 96\n\n⇒ 12 + __**18 × 6**__ - 24 = 96 \n\n⇒ __**12 + **108__ - 24 = 96 \n\n⇒ __120 - 24__ = 96\n\n⇒ **96 = 96**\n\n**⇒ LHS = RHS**\n\nOption 2) - and ×\n\nGiven: 144 - 12 + 18 × 6 ÷ 24 = 96\n\nAfter interchanging the numbers we get;\n\n⇒ 144 × 12 + 18 - __**6 ÷ 24**__ = 96\n\n⇒ __**144 ×**____** 12**__ + 18 - 0.25 = 96\n\n⇒ __**1728 **____**+ 18**__ - 0.25 = 96\n\n⇒ __**1746 - 0.25**__ = 96\n\n⇒ 1745.75 ≠ 96\n\n⇒ LHS ≠ RHS\n\nOption 3) × and ÷\n\nGiven: 144 - 12 + 18 × 6 ÷ 24 = 96\n\nAfter interchanging the numbers we get;\n\n⇒ 144 - 12 + __**18 ÷ 6**__ × 24 = 96 \n\n⇒ 144 - 12 + __3____** ×**____** 24**__ = 96 \n\n⇒ __**144**__ - 12 __**+ **__**__72__** = 96 \n\n⇒ __216 - 12__ = 96\n\n⇒ 204 ≠ 96\n\n⇒ LHS ≠ RHS\n\nOption 4) - and +\n\nGiven: 144 - 12 + 18 × 6 ÷ 24 = 96\n\nAfter interchanging the numbers we get;\n\n⇒ 144 + 12 - 18 × __**6 ÷ 24**__ = 96\n\n⇒ 144 + 12 - __**18 × 0.25**__ = 96\n\n⇒ __**144 +**____** 12**__ - 4.5 = 96\n\n⇒ __156____** - 4.5**__ = 96\n\n⇒ 151.5 ≠ 96\n\n⇒ LHS ≠ RHS\n\nHence, the correct answer is \"Option 1\".",
